 - [MOONDROP] DUSK | Note: crinaclette is hot + the details are really quite nice
 - [MOONDROP] GOLDEN AGE 1979 | Note: what can i say i fall for punk mitsukiyuki time and time again
 - [MOONDROP] Aria2 | Note: OH GOSH THIS IS GOOD. minor nitpick is slightly overly rounded iems but that's really a choice of how geometric you want to be
 - [MOONDROP] Beautiful World | Note: no complaints other than maybe some scaling type things
 - [MOONDROP] Starfield 2 | Note: HOLY SHIT THIS IS SO GOOD. even the use of odd color just.... works
 - [MOONDROP] Solis 2 | Note: What else did you expect for the solis 2?
 - [MOONDROP] MOONRIVER 2 TI | Note: HOLY FUCKING SHIT
 - [MOONDROP] CHENGDU-2 | Note: just an upgrade on blessing 3 prety much. while the iems arent represented its so much better
